n\u1ea5u v\u1eeba h\u1ecdc, v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u1ed1i n\u1ecd, c\u1eadu nh\u1ea5c c\u00e1i ch\u1ea3o n\u00f3ng c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng Trung m\u00e0 qu\u00ean l\u00f3t kh\u0103n. \`B\u1ecfng r\u1ed3i. N\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh, m\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u00fat, kh\u00f4ng c\u00e3i,\` \u00f4ng b\u00e1c s\u0129 ph\u1eabu thu\u1eadt n\u00f3i. \u00d4ng \u0111i ngang qua b\u1ebfp v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 tay gi\u1eef b\u00e0n tay \u0110\u1ee9c d\u01b0\u1edbi v\u00f2i n\u01b0\u1edbc. M\u00e3i sau \u0110\u1ee9c m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 \u00fd th\u1ea5y c\u00e2y g\u1eady ch\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng c\u1ee5 v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m c\u1ea1nh chi\u1ebfc gh\u1ebf. C\u1eadu kh\u00f4ng n\u00f3i g\u00ec. Gi\u00e1o tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e3 vi\u1ebft: \`L\u1ea7n kh\u00e1m \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean bao gi\u1edd c\u0169ng l\u00e0 kh\u00e1m b\u1eb1ng m\u1eaft. H\u00e3y nh\u00ecn tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ch\u1ea1m.\``},{`en`:`[[At]] [[the]] [[clinic]], Thu [[was|be]] [[tidying|tidy]] [[the]] [[waiting|wait]] [[room]] [[now]] [[that]] [[the]] [[flu]] [[was|be]] [[nearly]] [[over]]. [[The]] [[old]] [[poster]] [[about]] [[AIDS]] [[went|go]] [[back]] [[on]] [[the]] [[wall]], [[between]] [[a]] [[new]] [[one]] [[on]] [[obesity]] [[in]] [[children|child]] [[and]] [[one]] [[that]] [[called|call]] [[smoking]] \`an [[addiction]], [[not]] [[a]] [[habit]]\`. Duc [[picked|pick]] [[up]] [[two]] [[leaflets|leaflet]], \`[[Sleep]] [[disorders|disorder]]\` [[and]] \`[[Depression]] [[in]] [[older|old]] [[people]]\`, [[and]] [[read]] [[the]] [[second]] [[twice]]. \`[[Is|be]] [[that]] [[what]] Mr Trung [[has|have]]?\` \`[[A]] [[leaflet]] can't [[examine]] [[a]] [[patient]],\` [[said|say]] [[Doctor]] Hoa. \`[[Keep]] [[watching|watch]] [[him]], [[and]] [[tell]] [[me]] [[what]] [[you]] [[see]].\``,`vn`:`\u1ede ph\u00f2ng kh\u00e1m, d\u1ecbch c\u00fam \u0111\u00e3 g\u1ea7n h\u1ebft, v\u00e0 ch\u1ecb Thu d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p l\u1ea1i ph\u00f2ng ch\u1edd. T\u1ea5m \u00e1p ph\u00edch c\u0169 v\u1ec1 b\u1ec7nh AIDS \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c treo l\u1ea1i l\u00ean